meta {
  name: Direction Media Upload
  type: http
  seq: 10
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/directions/{{directionId}}/upload
  body: multipartForm
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Accept-Language: oz
}

body:multipart-form {
  files: @file(_samples/sample.png)
  ~lang: oz
}

docs {
  Mavjud yo'nalish yozuviga rasm qo'shish.

  Cheklovlar: jpg | jpeg | png | webp, har biri max 5MB, bitta so'rovda 100 tagacha.
  Yozuvdagi jami fayl soni ham 100 dan oshmasligi kerak.

  `lang` — har bir faylga til (oz|ru|uz|en|all). Yuborilsa FAYL SONI BILAN
  TENG bo'lishi shart. Bo'sh yoki `all` = barcha tillarda ko'rinadi.

  Birinchi yuklangan fayl avtomatik `is_main` bo'ladi (agar yozuvda fayl bo'lmasa).

  Qolgan fayl amallari (is-main, o'chirish, tartiblash, til almashtirish)
  `11-Media` papkasida — `table` env o'zgaruvchisini `directions` ga qo'ying.
}
